# breachwalker-web — Project charter

**What this is:** Static marketing site for Breachwalker on Cloudflare Pages. Landing, alpha signup (Tally), FAQ, SEO spokes, privacy/terms. **Discord community ops** (server provisioning scripts, webhook tests, invite/config SoT).

**What this is not:** Game client, Firebase **runtime** world-event webhooks, marketplace, wallet, or CMS. Those live in `../Breachwalker/` (Functions post to Discord; this repo provisions the server and holds the invite link).

## Always

- Prefer static Astro + zero/minimal client JS
- Keep player-facing strings in `src/data/*.ts` (`copy`, `seo-pages`, `faq`, `site`)
- Follow breach + rift vocabulary (skill `breachwalker-terminology`)
- Use design tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` — no Tailwind, no new color systems
- Preserve `trailingSlash: "always"` and use `pagePath` / `pageUrl` for internal links
- After SEO/copy/layout changes, run `npm run check` (and `verify-marketing-site` when visual)

## Never

- Hardcode diegetic Bitcoin/blockchain jargon on hero, teasers, how-it-works body, or gameplay FAQ answers
- Claim live NFT mint, wallet, or marketplace during closed alpha
- Surface private lore truth (monorepo Docs/10 §3) in any layer
- Add React/Vue/Svelte without an explicit need for interactivity
- Couple this deploy to the game client (`game.breachwalker.com`)

